Package: intune-zabbix-bridge
Version: 0.2.0
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Infiltrator Projects
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), zabbix-sender, ca-certificates, zabbix-frontend-php (>= 7.0)
Description: Microsoft Intune telemetry bridge and Zabbix reboot-watch widget
 Collects existing Microsoft Intune Windows reboot telemetry through Microsoft
 Graph and publishes fleet-level metrics to Zabbix. Includes the INTUNE Reboot
 Watch dashboard widget. The bridge does not contact or control managed endpoints.
